ship = YF-35E LAI
version = 1.0.5
description = A multirole fighter based on a fictional variant of the F-35, designed for speed, ECM, stealth, and solo capability. Ideal for deep strikes into enemy territory.¨¨The Low-Altitude Interceptor is specifically designed for fast, stealth ground attack. It is notable for modified rear landing gear to support the change in center of mass.¨¨1. Toggle afterburner.¨2. Fire weapon.¨3. Next weapon.¨4. Deploy flares/chaff.¨8. Enable ECM jamming and fuel cells.¨¨Tailplane is inspired by the YF-23, the rest of the F-35E design is based on the F-35, and of course, this version is a little different.¨¨Thanks to Time Symmetry (developer of Vector Thrust) for the idea!
type = SPH
size = 7.511056,2.855846,11.06611
